msgstr ""

msgid "Stare"
msgstr "Mirar fijamente"

msgid "Stare passionately"
msgstr "Mirar con pasión"

msgid "Stare calmly"
msgstr "Mirar con calma"

msgid "Stare blankly"
msgstr "Mirar distraído"

msgid "About Kushieda"
msgstr "Sobre Kushieda"

msgid "Tell me if I'm being overly friendly"
msgstr "Dime si soy demasiado confianzudo"

msgid "How long have we known each other?"
msgstr "¿Desde cuándo nos conocemos?"

msgid "Could you tell me a bit about yourself?"
msgstr "¿Me contarías un poco sobre ti?"

msgid "About New Year's"
msgstr "Sobre Año Nuevo"

msgid "You helped me a lot this year...... right?"
msgstr "Me ayudaste mucho este año...... ¿verdad?"

msgid "Public transit looks crowded everywhere"
msgstr "El transporte público se ve muy lleno"

msgid "Did you clean your house for New Year's?"
msgstr "¿Limpiaste tu casa para Año Nuevo?"

msgid "About Winter Break"
msgstr "Sobre las vacaciones de invierno"

msgid "Frankly, are you making a lot of money?"
msgstr "Sinceramente, ¿ganas mucho dinero?"

msgid "It's already halfway over"
msgstr "Ya van por la mitad"

msgid "Didn't we get homework over the break?"
msgstr "¿No teníamos tarea para las vacaciones?"

msgid "About Work"
msgstr "Sobre el trabajo"

msgid "You've got some serious work ethic!"
msgstr "¡Sí que tienes ética de trabajo!"

msgid "Are you saving up for something?"
msgstr "¿Estás ahorrando para algo?"

msgid "Must be hard working in food service"
msgstr "Debe ser duro trabajar en restaurantes"

msgid "About Taiga"
msgstr "Sobre Taiga"

msgid "Seems you two get along really well"
msgstr "Parece que se llevan muy bien"

msgid "She visited me while I was hospitalized"
msgstr "Me visitó cuando estuve hospitalizado"

msgid "I've had it up to here with her violence"
msgstr "Ya estoy harto de su violencia"

msgid "--Let's Have a Fun Chat with Minori!--"
msgstr "--¡Una charla divertida con Minori!--"

msgid "Minori「EYEEEE BEAMMM!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡RAYOOO OCULAAAR!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No such luck.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No hay tanta suerte.」"

msgid "Minori「Ahaha, I must have imagined it!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ajaja, me lo habré imaginado!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, it's cold.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, hace frío.」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, you've got a good point there!＿Thank ya kindly. Hehe!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ah, buen punto! ¡Te lo＿agradezco! ¡Jeje!」"

msgid "Minori「Umm, that's kinda......」"
msgstr "Minori「Emm, eso es un poco......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh......?」"

msgid "Minori「Nah, forget it, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Nah, olvídalo, amigo.」"

msgid "Minori「What is it? Sup?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué pasa? ¿Qué hay?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehh, bueno......」"

msgid "Minori「Aaaah! It's the rumored TAKASU＿BLIZZARDDDD!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Aaaah! ¡Es la famosa＿VENTISCA TAKASUUUU!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha-- Is there really a rumor like that＿going around?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qu-- En serio corre un＿rumor así por ahí?」"

msgid "Minori「Nope. Haha!」"
msgstr "Minori「Nop. ¡Jaja!」"

msgid "Minori「Yes, I died! And then, when your＿guard's down, I'LL RETURN!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sí, morí! ¡¡Y luego, cuando＿bajes la guardia, VOLVERÉ!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh? I had no time to react to that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿A-Ah? No alcancé a reaccionar.」"

msgid "Minori「Hehehe.」"
msgstr "Minori「Jejeje.」"

msgid "Minori「......'Sup?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Qué hay?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, err......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ehm......」"

msgid "Minori「Uh...... err......」"
msgstr "Minori「Eh...... ehm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Minori「Nah, it's nothin'.」"
msgstr "Minori「Nah, no es nada.」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... w-what's wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... ¿q-qué sucede?」"

msgid "Minori「......Nothing...... Yeah, it's nothing.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Nada...... Sí, no es nada.」"

msgid "Minori「......Hmm?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Mmm?」"

msgid "Minori「......Oho, a staring contest, eh?」"
msgstr "Minori「......Jojo, ¿un duelo de miradas, eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, no, let's not.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no, mejor no.」"

msgid "Minori「Stop right there!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Alto ahí!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry! Did I offend you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡P-Perdón! ¿Te ofendí?」"

msgid "Minori「Haha! Back at ya! Worrywart! Honestly,＿keep that up and you could get ulcers!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jaja, te la devolví, preocupón! ¡Así＿te va a salir una úlcera, en serio!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh...... Alright. Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah...... Está bien. Gracias.」"

msgid "Minori「Ooh, aah...... God, I can't stand it!」"
msgstr "Minori「Ooh, aah...... ¡Dios, no lo soporto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, did I say something weird?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿dije algo raro?」"

msgid "Minori「Ehehe, everything you say is weird!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ejeje, todo lo que dices es raro!」"

msgid "Minori「That's MY line. Seriously.」"
msgstr "Minori「Esa es MI frase. En serio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But I don't seem to recall that being＿the case.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero no recuerdo que ese＿haya sido el caso.」"

msgid "Minori「That might be true right now, but......＿Sorry, it's nothing. Thanks.」"
msgstr "Minori「Puede que ahora sea así, pero......＿Perdón, no es nada. Gracias.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Está bien......」"

msgid "Minori「Ohoho, shall I unleash the Kushieda?」"
msgstr "Minori「Ojojo, ¿desato a la Kushieda?」"

msgid "Minori「Snicker...... What wouldst thou prefer?」"
msgstr "Minori「Jijiji...... ¿Qué elige vuestra merced?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No no, I have no preference in this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no, no tengo ninguna preferencia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I wasn't really hoping for a joke.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, tampoco esperaba un chiste.」"

msgid "Minori「I reckon that's its own kind of＿loneliness.」"
msgstr "Minori「Supongo que eso tiene su＿propio tipo de soledad.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, moving on!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Bien, sigamos adelante!」"

msgid "Minori「My butt's cracked! Wait, I messed up,＿sorry. Forget I said that.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Se me partió el trasero! Espera, me＿equivoqué, perdón. Olvida lo que dije.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, there's no way I can forget it when＿you're making that expression.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no hay forma de olvidarlo＿cuando pones esa cara.」"

msgid "Minori「Since it's come to this, I must＿apologize with an act of hara-kiri.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya que llegamos a esto, debo disculparme＿haciéndome el harakiri.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, I'll forget it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Está bien, lo olvidaré!」"

msgid "Minori「Let's see, I'd say we knew each other's＿faces as freshmen.」"
msgstr "Minori「Veamos, diría que nos conocíamos＿de vista desde primer año.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Ah, en serio?」"

msgid "Minori「Now now, there's nothing wrong with＿remembering gradually, see.」"
msgstr "Minori「Vamos, vamos, no tiene nada de malo＿ir recordando poco a poco, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Uhhh, well, I sure hope you evolve＿into a human soon.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ehhh, bueno, espero que＿pronto evoluciones a humano.」"

msgid "Minori「Right back at you.」"
msgstr "Minori「Lo mismo te digo.」"

msgid "Minori「Any closer to the fire and you'll get＿burned!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Si te acercas más al fuego＿te vas a quemar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Seriously?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Minori「Seriously. Pa-KOW!」"
msgstr "Minori「En serio. ¡Pa-PUM!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Was that a warning shot?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Fue un disparo de advertencia?」"

msgid "Minori「Fufufu.」"
msgstr "Minori「Jujuju.」"

msgid "Minori「My BWH measurements, in order: 100,＿100, 100.」"
msgstr "Minori「Mis medidas son, en orden:＿100, 100, 100.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's with that look......? I mean, uhh,＿are you some kind of oil drum?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y esa mirada......? Digo, ehh, ¿acaso＿eres un barril de petróleo?」"

msgid "Minori「Thanks for playing along!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Gracias por seguirme el juego!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Short version, please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La versión corta, por favor.」"

msgid "Minori「I'm Kushieda Minori!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Soy Kushieda Minori!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That's it!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡¿Eso es todo?!」"

msgid "Minori「Hehehe.」"
msgstr "Minori「Jejeje.」"

msgid "Minori「Haha! With that unsure attitude of＿yours, I feel like saying \"You bet,＿maybe!\"」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jaja! Con esa actitud tuya tan＿insegura, me dan ganas de decir＿\"¡Por supuesto, tal vez!\"」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Was I always an unsure person?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Siempre fui una persona insegura?」"

msgid "Minori「Yup yup!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sip, sip!」"

msgid "Minori「And with that one thing, and the other＿thing, and the OTHER other thing!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Y con aquella cosa, y la otra＿cosa, y la OTRA otra cosa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, I...... I'm sorry I don't remember!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehh, yo...... ¡Perdón por no recordarlo!」"

msgid "Minori「Hold it right there! I wasn't trying to＿stress you out, bud. Sorry, sorry!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Alto ahí! No quería estresarte,＿amigo. ¡Perdón, perdón!」"

msgid "Minori「Ah, yeah, well, shit happens, bud. Same＿goes for me. Likewise, you helped me＿with heaps of stuff too.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah, sí, bueno, pasan mierdas, amigo.＿Lo mismo digo. Tú también me ayudaste＿con un montón de cosas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmm, did \"shit\" really happen?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmm, ¿de verdad pasaron \"mierdas\"?」"

msgid "Minori「......Whoops, I guess that was the wrong＿choice of words. Well, let's both make a＿fresh start this new year, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Ups, supongo que no elegí bien＿las palabras. Bueno, empecemos de＿cero este año nuevo, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Minori「Oh please, you helped ME out ten＿times as much. Look after Taiga this＿next year, too.」"
msgstr "Minori「Por favor, tú ME ayudaste diez＿veces más. Cuida de Taiga este＿año que viene también.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Likewise...... Wait, how does Taiga＿factor in?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Igualmente...... Espera, ¿qué＿tiene que ver Taiga en esto?」"

msgid "Minori「Hehehe.」"
msgstr "Minori「Jejeje.」"

msgid "Minori「As expected of a Kushieda, I cringe at＿the thought, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Como buena Kushieda, me da escalofríos＿de solo pensarlo, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, sorry, I meant from now on.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, perdón, decía de ahora en adelante.」"

msgid "Minori「Don't worry. I get it, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「No te preocupes. Lo entiendo, amigo.」"

msgid "Minori「Please pick up my bones.」"
msgstr "Minori「Por favor, recoge mis huesos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Marching to a tough battle like that is＿a sign of tragic determination, see.」"
msgstr "Minori「Marchar a una batalla así de dura＿muestra una trágica determinación, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, right, sorry. Do your best!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, claro, perdón. ¡Esfuérzate!」"

msgid "Minori「Thanks...... *Sigh*」"
msgstr "Minori「Gracias...... *Suspiro*」"

msgid "Minori「Once you start thinking like that, it's＿all over.」"
msgstr "Minori「En cuanto empiezas a pensar＿así, todo se acabó.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「True that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es cierto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wow, you said all that with a perfect＿straight face. I'm a little impressed.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Guau, dijiste todo eso tan seria.＿Me impresiona un poco.」"

msgid "Minori「But I'll sit down at the first＿opportunity.」"
msgstr "Minori「Pero me sentaré en cuanto tenga＿la menor oportunidad.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......O-Oh, don't hesitate to sit.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......A-Ah, no dudes en sentarte.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? Don't! Don't get depressed!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¡No! ¡No te deprimas!」"

msgid "Minori「It's okay. This, too, shall pass.」"
msgstr "Minori「Está bien. Esto también pasará.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I never said that, and I'm not a god＿either.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Yo nunca dije eso, y＿tampoco soy un dios.」"

msgid "Minori「Sorry, it was just a joke. I was just＿concerned about my own＿inexperience.」"
msgstr "Minori「Perdón, solo era una broma. Solo me＿preocupaba mi propia inexperiencia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, I went a little too far.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, me pasé un poco.」"

msgid "Minori「If you had said something like that, I＿would have been shocked even if I was＿finished.」"
msgstr "Minori「Si hubieras dicho algo así, me＿habría impresionado incluso si＿ya estuviera acabada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Am I that intimidating?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tan intimidante soy?」"

msgid "Minori「Not THAT much, but I get the feeling＿our interpretations of \"finished\" are＿much different, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「No TANTO, pero me da la sensación＿de que entendemos \"acabada\" de forma＿muy distinta, amigo.」"

msgid "Minori「Fufufu, I shalt not heareth that from＿thee, cretin!」"
msgstr "Minori「Jujuju, ¡no escucharé tal＿cosa de vos, cretino!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, that's most important.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, eso es lo más importante.」"

msgid "Minori「'Tis the season, y'know, for cold＿yellowtail!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Es temporada, ya sabes, de jurel frío!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, making fish rolls?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, ¿harás rollos de pescado?」"

msgid "Minori「And they shall gleam! Probably burn＿'em, set 'em on fire!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Y relucirán! ¡Seguro los＿quemo, les prendo fuego!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Don't play with fire, okay?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No juegues con fuego, ¿sí?」"

msgid "Minori「Of course hot!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Caliente, por supuesto!」"

msgid "Minori「Haha, you found me out! Am I that easy＿to read?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jaja, me descubriste! ¿Tan＿fácil soy de leer?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah, it was just a feeling I had.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nah, solo fue una corazonada.」"

msgid "Minori「I'm not THAT greedy...... am I? I＿probably am. I am! And this girl is fine＿with that! Wahahaha!」"
msgstr "Minori「No soy TAN codiciosa...... ¿o sí? Seguro＿que sí. ¡Lo soy! ¡Y a esta chica le＿parece bien! ¡Guajajaja!」"

msgid "Minori「I want to think it's more than that, but＿that's how it is.」"
msgstr "Minori「Quiero creer que es más que eso,＿pero así son las cosas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... W-Well, do your best.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... B-Bueno, esfuérzate.」"

msgid "Minori「I will. Thanks.」"
msgstr "Minori「Lo haré. Gracias.」"

msgid "Minori「Oho, but of course.」"
msgstr "Minori「Oho, por supuesto que sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, just don't wear yourself out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien, solo no te agotes.」"

msgid "Minori「Roger!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Entendido!」"

msgid "Minori「Ahh, yup, that's true. That's your way＿of thinking, though. Try looking at it as＿though there's still half remaining, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ahh, sip, es verdad. Pero esa es tu＿forma de pensar. Intenta verlo como＿que aún queda la mitad, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hmm, you're right. It's more positive＿that way.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Mmm, tienes razón.＿Así es más positivo.」"

msgid "Minori「Sorry, it kinda came off as a lecture.」"
msgstr "Minori「Perdón, sonó un poco a sermón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah, it's fine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nah, no pasa nada.」"

msgid "Minori「Repeat after me! \"Still half to go!\"」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Repite conmigo! \"¡Aún falta la mitad!\"」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Still half to go!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡A-Aún falta la mitad!」"

msgid "Minori「Okay!! See you, bye!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Bien!! ¡Nos vemos, adiós!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「B-Bye......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Adiós......」"

msgid "Minori「Time flies with godspeed.」"
msgstr "Minori「El tiempo vuela a velocidad divina.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Uhhh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Ehhh?」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, too hard? Sorry, sorry.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah, ¿muy difícil? Perdón, perdón.」"

msgid "Minori「There will come a plague wherein＿homework shall be forgotten.」"
msgstr "Minori「Vendrá una plaga en la que＿la tarea será olvidada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, it doesn't work like that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, eso no funciona así.」"

msgid "Minori「......Right now, I'm ashamed of myself for＿wishing for amnesia right in front of＿you. Better yet, hit me. Go on.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Ahora mismo me avergüenzo de mí＿misma por desear amnesia justo delante＿de ti. Mejor pégame. Anda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No no, you don't have to worry. Let's＿fight against reality.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no, no te preocupes. Luchemos＿contra la realidad.」"

msgid "Minori「Your words pain me.」"
msgstr "Minori「Tus palabras me hieren.」"

msgid "Minori「.........」"
msgstr "Minori「.........」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hey, when you're making that face,＿you look kinda, what's the word?＿Uncomfortable.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Oye, cuando pones esa＿cara, te ves como, ¿cuál es＿la palabra? Incómoda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I got it loud and clear. Gimme a break.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me quedó clarísimo. Dame un respiro.」"

msgid "Minori「Hehehe.」"
msgstr "Minori「Jejeje.」"

msgid "Minori「What washes up on tiny beaches?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué llega a las playas diminutas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I'm not making a punchline.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no voy a rematar el chiste.」"

msgid "Minori「The sightseeing fee is costly, you＿know?」"
msgstr "Minori「La tarifa turística sale cara, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... err, microwaves?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... ehm, ¿microondas?」"

msgid "Minori「Nice! Keep it up! Bring it on!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Bien! ¡Sigue así! ¡Con todo!」"

msgid "Minori「If you don't keep this conversation＿going, you'll die. Don't tell anyone.」"
msgstr "Minori「Si no mantienes esta charla viva,＿morirás. No se lo digas a nadie.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Are you trying to say that you're＿suffering money-wise?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Estás tratando de decir＿que andas mal de dinero?」"

msgid "Minori「I meant like, if a fish stops swimming it＿stops living, but...... to sum it up like＿that is way more embarrassing.」"
msgstr "Minori「Quería decir que, si un pez deja de＿nadar, muere, pero...... resumirlo＿así da mucha más vergüenza.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡P-Perdón!」"

msgid "Minori「Fufufu, no doubt you have the eyes of＿a dead fish right now.」"
msgstr "Minori「Jujuju, sin duda tienes ojos＿de pez muerto ahora mismo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No I don't!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Claro que no!」"

msgid "Minori「Something, maybe? Could be＿nothing...... Nope, it's probably＿something.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Para algo, tal vez? Puede que＿para nada...... Nop, probablemente＿sea para algo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You lost me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me perdí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, that's......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, eso es......」"

msgid "Minori「The world, I guess.」"
msgstr "Minori「El mundo, supongo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh? Is that more important than＿your part-time job at the diner?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Ah? ¿Importa más que tu trabajo＿de medio tiempo en el restaurante?」"

msgid "Minori「I have a long way to go, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Aún me queda mucho camino, amigo.」"

msgid "Minori「The thing I truly want is priceless.」"
msgstr "Minori「Lo que de verdad quiero no tiene precio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... Umm......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... Emm......」"

msgid "Minori「Whoops, sorry. Disregard that, please.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ups, perdón. Ignora eso, por favor.」"

msgid "Minori「Fufufu...... It's a secret. Why? Because＿it's more interesting that way!」"
msgstr "Minori「Jujuju...... Es un secreto. ¿Por qué?＿¡Porque así es más interesante!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「G-Got it...... though I don't get it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Entendido...... aunque no entiendo.」"

msgid "Minori「Well, that's because there are all kinds＿of customers, see.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, eso es porque hay todo＿tipo de clientes, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... Did I make you remember＿something bad? Sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... ¿Te hice recordar＿algo malo? Perdón.」"

msgid "Minori「No way, I'm totally fine.」"
msgstr "Minori「Para nada, estoy perfectamente bien.」"

msgid "Minori「If I look at it from the customer's point＿of view, I'm not fit to be in the service＿industry.」"
msgstr "Minori「Si lo miro desde el punto de vista＿del cliente, no sirvo para el＿sector de servicios.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Wait! I didn't mean it like that!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡E-Espera! ¡No lo decía por eso!」"

msgid "Minori「......Alright, I got a little ahead of myself＿there. But I want you to think about＿the meaning of \"daily reflection.\"」"
msgstr "Minori「......Bueno, me precipité un poco.＿Pero quiero que pienses en el sentido＿de la \"reflexión diaria\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I kinda feel bad now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ahora me siento un poco mal.」"

msgid "Minori「Don't forget the pay rate, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「No olvides la paga por hora, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, that's kinda cool.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, eso suena bastante genial.」"

msgid "Minori「Thanks!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Gracias!」"

msgid "Minori「Wanna give it a try?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Quieres intentarlo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Is this a scam?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Esto es una estafa?」"

msgid "Minori「You can't give up at the starting line!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No te rindas en la línea de salida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「R-Right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「C-Claro.」"

msgid "Minori「Of course, see! It's called the gambler's＿best friend! I mean childhood friend!＿Can't gamble with that! Haha!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Claro! ¡Es el mejor amigo del＿apostador! ¡Digo, amigo de la infancia!＿¡Eso no se apuesta! ¡Jaja!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......True that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Es verdad.」"

msgid "Minori「Hehe! Come on, having that said right＿to my face makes me, like, randomly＿awkward!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jeje! ¡Vamos, que me digan eso＿a la cara me hace sentir, no sé,＿como incómoda de la nada!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You don't have to feel awkward＿though.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Aunque no tienes por qué＿sentirte incómoda.」"

msgid "Minori「That's a deep, deep, DEEP friendship,＿see. OHO, the ultimate depth～!」"
msgstr "Minori「Amistad profunda, profunda, PROFUNDA,＿¿ves? ¡OHO, la máxima profundidad～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's what I want to say.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso es lo que yo quiero decir.」"

msgid "Minori「We don't \"seem\" to get along. We get＿along for a fact～!」"
msgstr "Minori「No \"parece\" que nos llevemos bien.＿¡Nos llevamos bien de verdad～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. Forgive my choice of words.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. Perdona cómo lo dije.」"

msgid "Minori「Good, good. Well? Doesn't Taiga have＿quite the admirable side, bud?」"
msgstr "Minori「Bien, bien. ¿Y? ¿Verdad que Taiga＿tiene su lado admirable, amigo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I guess...... but she said \"Get back to＿your senses already so you can do＿housework.\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo...... pero dijo: \"Recobra＿ya el juicio para que puedas hacer＿las tareas de la casa\".」"

msgid "Minori「Fufu, sounds like her!」"
msgstr "Minori「Juju, ¡suena muy propio de ella!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What are you talking about?!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿D-De qué estás hablando?!」"

msgid "Minori「But you know, I won't get in the way of＿two people connected by deeper ties!」"
msgstr "Minori「Pero sabes, ¡no me interpondré＿entre dos personas unidas por＿lazos más profundos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Like I said, what are you talking＿about?!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Como te dije, ¡¿de qué estás hablando?!」"

msgid "Minori「I see...... Oh, I'm really sorry I didn't visit＿you in the hospital.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo...... Ah, siento mucho no haberte＿visitado en el hospital.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's fine. Don't sweat it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien. No te preocupes.」"

msgid "Minori「You're ALWAYS looking after me＿usually, so I'm glad I left it in Taiga's＿hands.」"
msgstr "Minori「Normalmente SIEMPRE estás cuidando＿de mí, así que me alegra habérselo＿dejado a Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Minori「Yup yup, really.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sip, sip, en serio.」"

msgid "Minori「Do ya think talking to me about it will＿lead to a solution, bud? Or are ya just＿complainin'?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Crees que hablarlo conmigo llevará＿a una solución, amigo? ¿O solo＿te estás quejando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, no, well...... I'm not sure.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, no, bueno...... No estoy seguro.」"

msgid "Minori「I don't know either...... Well, it would be＿rude for the two of us to stick our＿noses into it now. It's too late.」"
msgstr "Minori「Yo tampoco lo sé...... Bueno, sería＿grosero que nosotros dos nos metiéramos＿ahora. Ya es muy tarde.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah......」"

msgid "Minori「Shouldn't you say that to her face＿directly!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿No deberías decírselo a ella＿directamente en la cara?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「D-Did I upset you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿T-Te molesté?」"

msgid "Minori「I don't like gossipy stuff.」"
msgstr "Minori「No me gustan los chismes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I understand. I'll stop.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entiendo. Ya paro.」"

msgid "Minori「Hmmm...... It kinda bothers me that you＿said that, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmmm...... Me molesta un poco que＿hayas dicho eso, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Minori「Well, I understand, but I wanted to let＿you know, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, lo entiendo, pero quería＿que lo supieras, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón.」"

